 "note": "One filesystem, one SQLite build, one page size, payloads small enough to stay in the b-tree. secure_delete is off by default and changes the answer. The first version of this probe held one connection open for every arm and reported that a VACUUM was insufficient; that state does not occur in a client that opens and closes per operation, which is why both lifecycles are measured here."
